# Hi there, I'm Edwin Thomas 👋

**Integrated MCA Student | Full-Stack & Desktop App Developer | Tech Enthusiast**

I'm a 20-year-old software developer currently pursuing my Integrated Master of Computer Applications (IMCA) at **De Paul Institute of Science and Technology (DiST)** in Kerala, India. I enjoy building responsive web applications, desktop utilities, and hardware/AI diagnostic tools from the ground up.

