###  Featured Projects

- ** TruthLENS** — A client-side AI image forensics web app built with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and ONNX / Multi-Crop Vision Transformers to detect AI-generated, manipulated, or re-encoded images.
- ** DetectX** — A glassmorphism web and Electron desktop hardware-detection tool that identifies CPU architectures/codenames, iGPUs, dedicated GPUs, and system RAM in real time alongside software and game compatibility.
- ** Statistic Tools Web** — An interactive web platform featuring 30+ statistical operations, dynamic Chart.js visualizations, SheetJS Excel exports, and an Appwrite backend.
- ** AutoFinish** — A C# Windows desktop utility designed to schedule system shutdowns and restarts seamlessly around Windows updates.

